        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend deep underground, dig and explore mines. Collect rare ores, upgrade your gear, and unlock new levels of procedurally generated dungeons. Each descent is a chance to find something valuable... or lose everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Down below, you’ll face more than just rocks: traps, cave-ins, blocked passages, and areas that require special tools. Use bombs to clear debris, manage your stamina, and plan your route — or risk getting stuck far beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your resources wisely, upgrade your base, and unlock new possibilities with each return. The deeper you go, the greater the danger — and the rewards.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend deep underground, dig and explore mines. Collect rare ores, upgrade your gear, and unlock new levels of procedurally generated dungeons. Each descent is a chance to find something valuable... or lose everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Down below, you’ll face more than just rocks: traps, cave-ins, blocked passages, and areas that require special tools. Use bombs to clear debris, manage your stamina, and plan your route — or risk getting stuck far beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your resources wisely, upgrade your base, and unlock new possibilities with each return. The deeper you go, the greater the danger — and the rewards.</p>",
